{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國家主席習近平抵達美國，展開國事訪問。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">習近平乘坐的專機在美國時間下午5時半左右，到達馬里蘭州安德魯斯聯合空軍基地。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.XI.AIRPORT-0630.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260ZKYnAeuxN1790203890.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.XI.AIRPORT-0630.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.XI.AIRPORT-0630_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260cQdPYWbca1790203893.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.XI.AIRPORT-0630_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美國以高規格迎接習近平到訪。總統特朗普及夫人梅拉尼亞破格親自在停機坪接機，美國三軍儀仗隊列隊歡迎習近平。習近平跟特朗普短暫交談後，與夫人彭麗媛乘坐紅旗牌專用座駕離開機場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T23:38:38.441816+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}